{"id":"666581","name":"四物养生糕","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/666581/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"红枣","amount":"150克"},{"name":"熟核桃仁","amount":"150克"},{"name":"枸杞","amount":"40克"},{"name":"熟黑芝麻","amount":"230克"},{"name":"水","amount":"50克"}],"sub":[{"name":"麦芽糖","amount":"220克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材。","img":"images/666581/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"红枣清洗干净，去核，对半剪开，取150克。","img":"images/666581/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"熟核桃仁(150克)。","img":"images/666581/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"熟黑芝麻230克。","img":"images/666581/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"克枸杞。","img":"images/666581/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"全部放入大碗中，翻拌均匀。","img":"images/666581/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"克水加入锅中。","img":"images/666581/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"克麦芽糖。","img":"images/666581/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"开中火熬化，起小泡泡转小火接着熬。","img":"images/666581/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"等到糖液起大泡了，铲子挑起来成倒三角就熬好了。","img":"images/666581/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"关火，倒入之前拌好的食材。","img":"images/666581/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"快速拌匀。","img":"images/666581/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"趁热倒进铺了油纸的容器里。","img":"images/666581/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"趁热整理平整，用擀面杖压实。","img":"images/666581/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"先切成长条状。","img":"images/666581/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再切成片。","img":"images/666581/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"好了。","img":"images/666581/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"美味又营养。","img":"images/666581/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}